      "rule": "檢查AI與地圖渲染只收Observation；C2 GameSession獨占GameState與applyCommand，main只用GameplayPort／LocalPersistencePort接線。顯示不得讀隱藏資料或完整Save/Replay。保護requestId去重、expectedVersion、generation與publication重入；匯入先完整驗證再取消AI與替換；保存只有IO成功且同stamp才ack；非同步AI取消；mouse/touch/keyboard可操作，禁未信任innerHTML/eval、全域吞錯與DOM selector patch，Responsive無遮擋、無consoleerror、尊重reducedmotion。"
